il gelatinase associated lipocalin as a biomarker for acute kidney injury in patients undergoing coronary artery bypass grafting with cardiopulmonary bypass</article-title><source><italic>Annals of Vascular Surgery</italic></source><year>2010</year><volume>24</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>525</fpage><lpage>531</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-77951666610</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20363104</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B22"><label>22</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wagener</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Jan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Association between increases in urinary neutrophil gelatinase-associated lipocalin and acute renal dysfunction after adult cardiac surgery</article-title><source><italic>Anesthesiology</italic></source><year>2006</year><volume>105</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>485</fpage><lpage>491</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-33748127615</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16931980</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B23"><label>23</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dent</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Dastrala</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Plasma neutrophil gelatinase-associated lipocalin predicts acute kidney injury, morbidity and mortality after pediatric cardiac surgery: a prospective uncontrolled cohort study</article-title><source><italic>Critical Care</italic></source><year>2007</year><volume>11</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>p. R127</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-38349195608</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B24"><label>24</label><element-citation pu